o": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01722000/RJ01721422/b266a58e389a4411cbfb324e66bb6f08.jpg", "alt": "【Windows+Android版】Wet and Messy Simulator -わむしむ- [AquaBrace]", "title": "【Windows+Android版】Wet and Messy Simulator -わむしむ- [AquaBrace]"}, "position": "right"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "二人で300個のボイスを搭載", "body": [{"intro": "液体に対するリアクションボイスと、興奮度に応じたコメントボイスを二人で合計300個搭載。<br />\r\n興奮度ゲージがMAXになると、ご褒美ボイスモードに突入します。", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01722000/RJ01721422/eecb0b8d194ee551c6e43e5eda4becc1.jpg", "alt": "【Windows+Android版】Wet and Messy Simulator -わむしむ- [AquaBrace]", "title": "【Windows+Android版】Wet and Messy Simulator -わむしむ- [AquaBrace]"}, "position": "left"}]}, {"type": "image_list", "title": "キャラクター紹介", "body": [{"intro": "- 澪 - <br />\r\n義理の妹。お兄ちゃん大好きっ子。お兄ちゃんの変態行動にしぶしぶ付き合っていたが…?", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01722000/RJ01721422/2c01e43d6c7149f127eb55200b72a244.jpg", "alt": "【Windows+Android版】Wet and Messy Simulator -わむしむ- [AquaBrace]", "title": "【Windows+Android版】Wet and Messy Simulator -わむしむ- [AquaBrace]"}}, {"intro": "- 葵 - <br />\r\n神社の一人娘。主人公と友好を深めるうちに変な道に…?", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01722000/RJ01721422/edeced7870dbb0035f6edeccc86593d0.jpg", "alt": "【Windows+Android版】Wet and Messy Simulator -わむしむ- [AquaBrace]", "title": "【Windows+Android版】Wet and Messy Simulator -わむしむ- [AquaBrace]"}}, {"intro": "【澪衣装】<br />\r\n夏服(ベスト)<br />\r\n冬服(ブレザー)<br />\r\nメイド服<br />\r\n<br />\r\nそれぞれお座りと寝転びの2タイプ", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01722000/RJ01721422/1b522e15e7815d9d983c5e83489cec25.jpg", "alt": "【Windows+Android版】Wet and Messy Simulator -わむしむ- [AquaBrace]", "title": "【Windows+Android版】Wet and Messy Simulator -わむしむ- [AquaBrace]"}}, {"intro": "【葵衣装】<br />\r\n夏服(半袖セーラー)<br />\r\n冬服(長袖セーラー)<br />\r\n巫女装束<br />\r\n<br />\r\nそれぞれお座りと寝転びの2タイプ", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01722000/RJ01721422/9c